{"text":"We believe in the father working far from home, sending money back so his family might have a better life. We believe in the mother who goes without so that her children might have something more. We believe in the laborer earning his daily wage and the student pursuing her degree. We believe in a young boy who knows that if he just keeps studying, if he's just given the chance, his hopes might be realized too. We are all beautiful flowers from the same garden, branches of the same majestic tree. And I am the first American President to come to your country twice, but I predict I will not be the last, because as Americans, we believe in the promise of India, we believe in the people of India, we are proud to be your friend, we are proud to be your partner as you build the country of your dreams. Jaya Han, thank you.","words":[{"text":"We","start":0.68,"end":1.18},{"text":"believe","start":1.18,"end":1.5},{"text":"in","start":1.5,"end":1.68},{"text":"the","start":1.68,"end":1.78},{"text":"father","start":1.78,"end":2.02},{"text":"working","start":2.02,"end":2.4},{"text":"far","start":2.4,"end":2.66},{"text":"from","start":2.66,"end":2.86},{"text":"home","start":2.86,"end":3.18,"punct":","},{"text":"sending","start":3.58,"end":3.76},{"text":"money","start":3.76,"end":4.04},{"text":"back","start":4.04,"end":4.28},{"text":"so","start":4.28,"end":4.44},{"text":"his","start":4.44,"end":4.58},{"text":"family","start":4.58,"end":4.82},{"text":"might","start":4.82,"end":5.06},{"text":"have","start":5.06,"end":5.22},{"text":"a","start":5.22,"end":5.34},{"text":"better","start":5.34,"end":5.46},{"text":"life","start":5.46,"end":5.72,"punct":"."},{"text":"We","start":6.92,"end":7.1},{"text":"believe","start":7.1,"end":7.42},{"text":"in","start":7.42,"end":7.68},{"text":"the","start":7.68,"end":8.04},{"text":"mother","start":8.04,"end":8.24},{"text":"who","start":8.24,"end":8.44},{"text":"goes","start":8.44,"end":8.72},{"text":"without","start":8.72,"end":9.14},{"text":